arne la chiusura in qualsiasi modo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"A World Apart","overview":"Elementary school teacher Michele Cortese is about to start a whole new life. After 40 years of teaching in the metropolitan Roman jungle, he had to move to a village in Central Italy, to teach in a tiny school with just a few children aged 7-10. Struggling to overcome his urban inadequacy, he finds a friendly face in vice-principal Agnese and gradually manages to fit in, thanks to her and their spirited pupils. As everything seems to be falling into place, unwelcome news comes through: the school has failed to meet its student quota for the next year and will soon be shut for good."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5ZibJ7crzGLLQ5AygBexzQMtR4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2CtKnSi5SQ3aZc9Af25bsVv6Rcu.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1109306,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5ZibJ7crzGLLQ5AygBexzQMtR4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f5ZibJ7crzGLLQ5AygBexzQMtR4.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f5ZibJ7crzGLLQ5AygBexzQMtR4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f5ZibJ7crzGLLQ5AygBexzQMtR4.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/26XVOQS2YO7JVZ95q0h9BPoyJIE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/26XVOQS2YO7JVZ95q0h9BPoyJIE.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5SIFqg7n2wEYtV4L4ZKkyiX5JqD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5SIFqg7n2wEYtV4L4ZKkyiX5JqD.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"avail